## Overview

This configuration provisions the OCI networking required for cross-region
Oracle Data Guard using a three-module pattern:

| Module | What it builds |
|--------|---------------|
| `module.primary` | Hub VCN, LPGs, DRG, route tables, NSG rules in the **primary** region |
| `module.dr` | Same networking mirrored in the **DR** region |
| `module.drg_peering` | Cross-region Remote Peering Connection that activates the DRG link |

The two region modules are independent and apply in parallel. The peering module
runs only after both are complete (`depends_on`).

