## Outputs

After `terraform apply` completes:

```bash
terraform output primary_hub_vcn_id   # OCID of the primary Hub VCN
terraform output dr_hub_vcn_id        # OCID of the DR Hub VCN
terraform output primary_drg_id       # OCID of the primary DRG
terraform output dr_drg_id            # OCID of the DR DRG
terraform output primary_rpc_id       # OCID of the primary Remote Peering Connection
terraform output dr_rpc_id            # OCID of the DR Remote Peering Connection
terraform output peering_status       # Should be PEERED after successful apply
```

Verify peering is active:
```bash
terraform output peering_status
# Expected: "PEERED"
```

